SUMMARY:Misc Connections: An Olio House Party
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're looking for new friends\, lovers\, or someone wi
 th a boat\, we're here to make it happen for you. One of our favorite part
 s of running Olio (a miscellaneous collection of art + people) is making c
 onnections between our members based on their niche hobbies\, interests\, 
 or that certain je ne sais quoi.&nbsp\;Become a member to join the party\,
  and you'll enter a whole new world of connections through an evening of c
 urated conversation groups and a dance floor to boogie.&nbsp\;What to expe
 ct:8pm: You're matched with new friends to discuss a few curated prompts a
 nd meet the others in the space.9:30pm-midnight: Hang with your new friend
 s\, dance and vibe out to an array of Latin American DJ sets (lot radio an
 d NTS radio stuff..not live but we'll project them and it will be fun)&nbs
 p\;We're limiting this event to 40ish people so we can have plenty of spac
 e for small group convos and a chance to meet everyone in the room.&nbsp\;
 Tickets:To attend this party you can sign up for our monthly membership wh
 ich gives you two\, $35 credits to use towards Olio events each month.&nbs
 p\;You must be 21 or older to attend.What is Think Olio?Think Olio is an o
 ngoing experiment in lifelong learning. We are a community of open-minded 
 people who gather to exchange ideas with new friends and connect over art\
 , literature\, and philosophy.An Olio is what we call the social learning 
 events we’ve been organizing since 2015. A blend between a lecture and a
  house party\, Olios are led by a teacher who loves sharing their passions
  and the room is filled with curious\, open-minded New Yorkers.&nbsp\;Eigh
 t months into creating a venue\, one of our favorite feelings has been the
  moments where we’ve stepped outside of time. We’ve created a space wh
 ere conversations don’t feel rushed\, people are greeted with hugs\, and
  as a community\, we spontaneously come up with new ideas (like the dial-u
 p-disco house party) and bring them to life.Our goal is to spark new persp
 ectives\, ignite curiosity\, and enjoy ourselves socially—an alternative
  to typical nightlife options.Check out our full calendarDisclaimer: By pu
 rchasing a ticket\, you agree to have your photo/video used for social med
 ia/marketing materials. If you prefer to not have your photo taken\, feel 
 free to send us a note.\n\nTickets & info: https://www.viewcy.com/event/mi
 sc_connections_an
URL:https://www.viewcy.com/event/misc_connections_an
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:300a3ef1-1148-4796-9f35-4d424c6a3e37@viewcy.olio
